{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1785260916,"nonce":"kSQXBKTUUyMybiZfwjFMsJIBTa0=","title":"ADR-0063 s1: rename the workspace service to the Data Depot","message":"\"Workspace service\" named the component after **one of its tenants**, and the name broke when a second kind of data arrived. It now holds the warm CAS, Snapshot Farms, Workspace Exports, the Step-log namespace (ADR-0063) and Cache (ADR-0065). `warm store` was rejected for naming it after one of its *properties* — that encodes a tiering decision and dates the same way.\n\n**Operator-facing breaking change** (env vars, chart values, role flag). Cheap now because nothing is released; expensive at any later point.\n\nRename:\n- `--role workspace` → `--role depot`; `Role::Workspace` → `Role::Depot`\n- `WorkspaceServiceConfig` → `DepotConfig`\n- `SCARAB_WORKSPACE_URL` → `SCARAB_DEPOT_URL`; `SCARAB_WORKSPACE_DATA_DIR` → `SCARAB_DEPOT_DATA_DIR`\n- `crates/scarab-server/src/workspaced.rs` → `depotd.rs`\n- chart `{service,serviceaccount,statefulset}-workspace.yaml` → `*-depot.yaml`; values `workspace.*` → `depot.*`\n- `just workspace-logs`/`workspace-status` → `just depot-logs`/`depot-status`\n\n**Do NOT rename** (correctly named): **Workspace**, **Workspace Snapshot**, **Workspace Export**; `SCARAB_WORKSPACE_TOKEN_SECRET` (it mints the token a Step Pod presents to read *workspace snapshots* — its claims are literally snapshot `roots`); `crates/scarab-workspace-client` (fetches workspace snapshots for the fetcher init container).\n\n- [ ] Rename lands in one commit so no intermediate state has both names\n- [ ] CLAUDE.md, ADR-0061/0062 prose, and `deploy/*/README.md` updated\n- [ ] `just up` and `just local-helm` both still work end to end","files":null}]}